            <h3>Download all content</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.84rem">Bundles every JSON content file (settings, pricing, testimonials, FAQ, portfolio, all services, integrations) into a single ZIP. Includes the current edits you've made in this session.</p>
